{"key":"enterprise/T1204","id":"T1204","name":"User Execution","domain":"enterprise","level":"technique","parent_id":null,"tactics":["execution"],"platforms":["Linux","Windows","macOS","IaaS","Containers"],"environments":["cloud","cloud-hosted-endpoint","containers","onprem"],"environment_basis":"project_taxonomy_from_upstream_platforms","summary":"An adversary may rely upon specific actions by a user in order to gain execution. Users may be subjected to social engineering to get them to execute malicious code by, for example, opening a malicious document file or link. These user actions will typically be observed as follow-on behavior from forms of Phishing. While User Execution frequently occurs shortly after Initial Access it may occur at other phases of an intrusion, such as when an…","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1204","source_stix_id":"attack-pattern--8c32eb4d-805f-4fc5-bf60-c4d476c131b5","source_modified":"2025-10-24T17:49:04.940Z","source_object_version":"1.8","telemetry":{"status":"mapped","components":[{"id":"DC0038","name":"Application Log Content","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0038","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--9c2fa0ae-7abc-485a-97f6-699e3b6cf9fa","page":"telemetry/DC0038/"},{"id":"DC0072","name":"Container Creation","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0072","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--a5ae90ca-0c4b-481c-959f-0eb18a7ff953","page":"telemetry/DC0072/"},{"id":"DC0077","name":"Container Start","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0077","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--5fe82895-28e5-4aac-845e-dc886b63be2e","page":"telemetry/DC0077/"},{"id":"DC0055","name":"File Access","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0055","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--235b7491-2d2b-4617-9a52-3c0783680f71","page":"telemetry/DC0055/"},{"id":"DC0039","name":"File Creation","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0039","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--2b3bfe19-d59a-460d-93bb-2f546adc